<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-FIVE NATIONS' SECOND ROUND STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FIVE NATIONS' SECOND ROUND STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings after the second round of</p>
<p>the Five Nations' championship on Saturday (tabulate under</p>
<p>	played, won, lost, draw, points for, against, points):</p>
<p>England  1   1     0	0	41	   13	   2</p>
<p>France   1   1     0	0	32	   15	   2</p>
<p>Wales    2   1     0	1	59	   45	   2</p>
<p>Ireland  2   1     0	1	41	   57	   2</p>
<p>Scotland 2   0     0	2	32	   75	   0</p>
<p>Results: Jan 18; Ireland 15 France 32, Scotland 19 Wales</p>
<p>34. Feb 1; England 41 Scotland 13, Wales 25 Ireland 26.</p>
<p>Remaining fixtures: Feb 15; France v Wales, Ireland v England.</p>
<p>March 1; England v France, Scotland v Ireland. March 15; Wales v</p>
<p>England, France v Scotland.</p>
